# Bitter Baitling from Jang in Booty Bay for one Extravagant Extravaganza Coin.
# Sources: npcs.json (Jang); Forever client 1.60.1.70338 via wago.tools.
# How the coin is earned is not in what we have; Jang runs Booty Bay's fishing
# contest in Era.

step Extravagant Extravaganza Coin
  tip The Bitter Baitling is a fishing reward: Jang trades it for one Extravagant Extravaganza Coin, a reward of the fishing contest Jang runs in Booty Bay. The coin's exact source is not published yet.
  collect 274026 "Extravagant Extravaganza Coin" @27.4,76.8 -- Jang, Booty Bay

step Jang
  tip Jang stands on the Booty Bay docks.
  vendor 15078                        -- Jang
  buy 276275 "Bitter Baitling" npc 15078 -- 1 Extravagant Extravaganza Coin
